    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="1045" n="[1002]" xml:id="pg1002"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to the online version of <ref
                        target="frus:frus1969-76v21">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume XXI,
                        Chile, 1969–1973</ref>. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been
                    revised. </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Footnote 3, Document 342. </hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The original footnote had an incorrect cross reference. The revised
                        footnote reads: “3. See <ref target="frus:frus1969-76v21/d339">Document
                            339</ref> and <ref target="frus:frus1969-76ve16/d138">Document 138 in
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, vol.
                            E–16, Documents on Chile, 1969–1973</ref>.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
